 ["Todupuzha","Falls the month after Ramayyan's death in January 1756, yet the same page also says it was lost in January (p. 143)."],
 ["Paterre","The king's camp on 14 August 1741. The author writes that he could not find it on the map (p. 159 n.)."],
 ["The marriage","Dated only 'probably in 1744', and the story of the refusal rests on Anquetil du Perron (pp. 170-171)."],
